# Morinus keeps charts (.hor), settings (.opt) and the place list (.dat) as
# Python pickles; the older ones are plain text with LF line ends, and git on
# Windows would add a CR to every line (a chart named "Morinus" became
# "Morinus\r"). They, and the ephemeris data, are kept byte for byte.
*.hor binary
*.opt binary
*.dat binary
*.gz binary
SWEP/Ephem/** -text
